---
layout: base.njk
title: Mentions légales
description: "Mentions légales du site d'Erwan Badir, designer graphique et directeur artistique."
bodyClass: page-infos
permalink: /mentions-legales/
---
<div class="infos">
  <h1 class="infos__h">Mentions légales</h1>
  <div class="legal">
    {% for s in infos.legalSections %}
    <details class="legal-item">
      <summary class="legal-item__title"><span class="legal-title-text" data-emoji="{{ s.emoji }}">{{ s.title }}</span></summary>
      <div class="legal-item__body">
        {% for para in s.body | paragraphs %}<p>{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
